s\") are used for a broad spectrum of functions or missions. This theme focuses on spatial representation of real property assets only and does not seek to describe special purpose functions of real property such as those found in the Cultural Resources, Transportation, or Utilities themes.\"</span></div><div style='font-size:17px;'>&nbsp;</div></div></div></div><div style='color:rgb(77, 77, 77); margin:0px; padding:0px;'><div style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'><div style='color:rgb(76, 76, 76);'><span style='color:#000000; font-family:inherit; font-size:large;'><font style='font-family:inherit;'>For other NGDA Content:</font></span><span style='color:#4c4c4c; font-family:inherit; font-size:large;'><font style='font-family:inherit;'>&nbsp;</font></span><a style='color:rgb(0, 94, 149); font-family:&quot;Avenir Next W01&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next W00&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; text-decoration-line:none; text-overflow:ellipsis;' target='_blank' href='https://fedmaps.maps.arcgis.com/home/group.html?id=8c90888d825d440a9e4754fda9e4e92e' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'><span style='font-size:large;'>Esri Federal Datasets</span></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>",
